[CENTER][SIZE=5][B]🚆 1.0.0.8 — Web map polish[/B][/SIZE]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdreval/Create-Dynmap-Bridge/main/docs/images/web-map-overview.jpg[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdreval/Create-Dynmap-Bridge/main/docs/images/station-popup-at-station.jpg[/IMG]  [IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mdreval/Create-Dynmap-Bridge/main/docs/images/station-popup-heading-here.jpg[/IMG][/CENTER]

[LIST]
[*][B]🚉 Clickable stations[/B] — fixed: clicking a station now opens a window with trains [B]at the station[/B] and trains [B]heading there[/B] (distance, speed). It updates live; click a train to follow it.
[*][B]🚆 Train list per dimension[/B] — only trains of the selected dimension, plus "+N in other dimensions".
[*][B]┅ Legend for invisible tracks[/B] — dashed lines are phantom tracks: trains use them, but they are invisible in the game.
[*][B]🌍 Readable dimension names[/B] — minecraft:old is shown as Old.
[*][B]🌀 Portals[/B] — clicking a portal jumps to its exit in the other dimension.
[*][B]🎨 Dark scrollbars[/B] and a wider station window without sideways scrolling.
[*][B]🔄 Updates load right away[/B] — browsers no longer keep the old website after a plugin update.
[/LIST]

[B]Upgrade:[/B] replace the jar with 1.0.0.8, restart the server and reload the map once with Ctrl + F5.
